  "notes": [
    "Regular -IR verb. Follows standard -IR endings throughout all tenses with no exceptions.",
    "Regular past participle: *asistido*",
    "Primary meaning is \"to attend\" (an event, class, meeting): *asistir a una reunión* (to attend a meeting).",
    "Secondary meaning is \"to assist/help\", though *ayudar* is more common for everyday help.",
    "Note the preposition: *asistir a* + event (not *asistir* alone).",
    "*¿Vas a asistir a la conferencia?* (Are you going to attend the conference?)",
    "*Asistí a todas las clases este mes.* (I attended all the classes this month.)",
    "Related: la asistencia (attendance/assistance), el/la asistente (assistant/attendee)"
  ],
